# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT — read before adding a pattern here.
#
# A pattern with NO slash in it matches that name at EVERY depth,
# not just the repo root. Combined with core.ignorecase=true on
# Windows, a bare line like `UrduCanvas` silently swallowed the
# whole `com/webscare/urducanvas/` source package for a month:
# new .kt files were never staged, never pushed, and were lost on
# the next clone. `git status` stayed clean the entire time.
#
# RULE: if you mean a specific file or folder, anchor it with a
# leading slash (`/UrduCanvas`). Only leave a pattern unanchored
# when you genuinely want it matched everywhere (e.g. *.iml).
#
# After editing this file, ALWAYS verify nothing in the source
# tree got caught:
#   git ls-files --others --ignored --exclude-standard -- app/src
# That must print nothing.
#
# .githooks/pre-commit runs exactly that check and blocks the commit
# if it finds anything. Enable it once per clone with:
#   git config core.hooksPath .githooks
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Gradle / build output ────────────────────────────────────
.gradle/
.kotlin/
/build
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx

# ── IDE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.iml
/.idea/caches
/.idea/libraries
/.idea/modules.xml
/.idea/workspace.xml
/.idea/navEditor.xml
/.idea/assetWizardSettings.xml
/.idea/deploymentTargetSelector.xml
/.idea/deploymentTargetDropDown.xml

# ── OS cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Local machine config (never commit) ──────────────────────
/local.properties

# ── Signing material (never commit) ──────────────────────────
# `/UrduCanvas` is the root-level PKCS#12 keystore. It is ANCHORED
# on purpose — unanchored, it also matched app/src/main/java/com/
# webscare/urducanvas/. That was the bug described above.
/UrduCanvas
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
keystore.properties
signing.properties

# ── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.apk
*.aab
*.aar
/app/release/
/app/prod/release/
/app/dev/
/app/devAds/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SAFETY NET — THIS MUST STAY AT THE BOTTOM OF THE FILE.
# Add new patterns ABOVE this block, never below it.
#
# gitignore resolves by "last matching pattern wins", so these
# negations re-include the source tree even if a pattern above
# accidentally matched it. Appending a pattern *below* them
# defeats them — which is why .githooks/pre-commit exists as an
# order-independent backstop.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!/app/src/**
!/app/*.gradle.kts
!/app/proguard-rules.pro
!/build.gradle.kts
!/settings.gradle.kts
!/gradle/**
!/gradlew
!/gradlew.bat
